---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="about"
	description="Notes on networking and security, written by Matt Moses."
>
	<img
		class="about-mark"
		src="/images/mattmdev-logo-pcb.svg"
		alt="mattm.dev"
		width="640"
		height="200"
	/>
	<h1>about</h1>
	<div class="prose">
		<p>
			This is a small blog about networking and security -- the kind of
			detail that's easy to skim past in a man page and expensive to
			get wrong in production. Posts are short, technical, and written
			for people who'd rather read a packet capture than a marketing
			page.
		</p>
		<p>
			Get new posts over <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>, or find the source
			for this site
			<a href="https://github.com/matt-moses/mattm.dev">on GitHub</a>.
		</p>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
